Forrasztóállomás EINHELL Akkus forrasztópisztoly TE-SI 18/480 Li-Solo, 4520400 (akku nélkül):





	The Einhell TE-SI 18/480 Li E Solo cordless soldering iron allows for mobile soft soldering without a mains connection. It is suitable for soldering printed circuit boards, cables, wires, and LEDs. It is supplied without a battery and charger. The soldering iron is ready to use in approximately 20 seconds. The temperature can be adjusted between 200°C and 480°C using the large adjustment wheel. The LCD displays the current temperature of the soldering tip, and a multicolour LED indicates the heating and operating status. When the set temperature is reached, the LED turns green. The ergonomically shaped soft grip handle ensures a comfortable and secure hold. The holder with touch protection allows for the safe storage of the soldering iron while it cools down and is also designed for storing the soldering iron. The soldering tip can be replaced without tools.&nbsp;


















